:: f4 [map]
<<map 'f4'>><<n>><<w>><</map>><<set $currentLocation = 'f4'>>\
!!!!EXPLORE
[[Talk to the merchant.->f4: merchant]]
[[Check the long grass.->f4: long grass]]

:: f4: merchant
There's a merchant here!

She seems friendly.

"I wait here to collect the rafts that people use to float down the Great River."

"We also have e-bikes in stock! They're available for the low price of 1,000 coins."

[[That seems quite absurd. Try to haggle.->f4: haggle]]
[[Another time.->f4]]

:: f4: haggle
<<if (($keywords.paddle == true) and ($keywords.shine == true))>>
    "You've beaten Rhia *and* Matiu in the school challenge?"

    You can have one for free!

    <<link 'You get an ebike!' 'f4'>><<set $keywords.ebike = true>><</link>>
<<elseif $keywords.paddle == true>>
    "You already tackled the Wave School challenge and won?!" she says.

    "Rhia is so impressive. Don't you think? I wish I had half of her fashion sense."

    She looks you up and down with a surprised look. "You must be quite skilled with Mergimals. I can give you a discount: only 1/10th of the normal price."

    <<nobr>>
        <<link 'Sure!'>>
            <<if $backpack.coin < 100>>
                <<dialog 'not enough coins'>>\
                    <<include 'not enough coins'>>
                <</dialog>>
            <<else>>
                <<set $backpack.coin -= 100>>
                <<set $keywords.ebike = true>>
            <</if>>
        <</link>>
    <</nobr>>
    [[Nevermind.->f4]]
<<elseif $keywords.shine == true>>
    "You already tackled the Forge School challenge and won?!" she says.

    "Matiu seems kinda scary. I don't know how you were able to work up the courage to even try!"

    She looks you up and down with a surprised look. "You must be quite skilled with Mergimals. I can give you a discount: only 1/10th of the normal price."

    <<nobr>>
        <<link 'Sure!'>>
            <<if $backpack.coin < 100>>
                <<dialog 'not enough coins'>>\
                    <<include 'not enough coins'>>
                <</dialog>>
            <<else>>
                <<set $backpack.coin -= 100>>
                <<set $keywords.ebike = true>>
            <</if>>
        <</link>>
    <</nobr>>
    [[Nevermind.->f4]]
<<else>>
    "Sorry to say, I can't do any better."

    "Come back when you've completed some school challenges."

    <<nobr>>
        <<link 'Alright, I guess.'>>
            <<if $backpack.coin < 1000>>
                <<dialog 'not enough coins'>>\
                    <<include 'not enough coins'>>
                <</dialog>>
            <<else>>
                <<set $backpack.coin -= 1000>>
                <<set $keywords.ebike = true>>
            <</if>>
        <</link>>
    <</nobr>>
    [[Nevermind.->f4]]
<</if>>

:: f4: long grass
Test two cards.

You got...

<<link '...zero correct.' 'stray encounter'>>
    <<set $mergimalEncountered = $mergimals[$encounterTable[$currentLocation].common]>>
<</link>>
<<link '...one correct.' 'stray encounter'>>
    <<set $mergimalEncountered = $mergimals[$encounterTable[$currentLocation].uncommon]>>
<</link>>
<<link '...two correct.' 'stray encounter'>>
    <<set $mergimalEncountered = $mergimals[$encounterTable[$currentLocation].rare]>>
<</link>>
[[Continue exploring.->$currentLocation]]